#: ../../getting_started/requirements/requirements.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Memory:** `16 GB recommended "
"<https://support.morpheusdata.com/s/article/How-does-Morpheus-manage-the-"
"memory-it-uses?language=en_US>`_ for default installations. 8 GB minimum "
"required with 4 GB+ available storage swap space"
